OL,3,GNEWSAWhy I'm visiting every Little Chef
OL,4,Asite in the UK
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt was the roadside treat for millions
OL,7,Fon their way to UK holiday
OL,8,Fdestinations.
OL,10,FNow one man has made it his mission to
OL,11,Fvisit every former Little Chef site in
OL,12,Fthe UK.
OL,14,FOliver Hyam's love of the chain's
OL,15,FOlympic breakfasts, Jubilee pancakes
OL,16,Fand lollipops spawned a hobby that has
OL,17,Flasted 12 years so far.
OL,19,F"I'm 27, so I wasn't even alive for
OL,20,Fmuch of Little Chef's operation," he
OL,21,Ftold BBC Radio Stoke.
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
